{"schema_version":1,"id":"018f0000-0000-7000-8000-00000000c849","stream":{"kind":"session","id":"01a0d172-aa29-7082-8eff-67d931aefab6"},"sequence":639,"recorded_at":1780531400001273,"record_type":"event","durability":"durable","causation_id":"cc58f923-5939-4fc8-a20e-d72a2117b375","payload_type":"task.lifecycle.output","payload_schema_version":1,"payload":{"kind":"task_lifecycle","command_id":"cc58f923-5939-4fc8-a20e-d72a2117b375","run_stream":{"kind":"run","id":"cc58f923-5939-4fc8-a20e-d72a2117b375"},"task_stream":{"kind":"task","id":"01a0d17a-a6dc-7090-8380-6563b0487b98"},"task_id":"01a0d17a-a6dc-7090-8380-6563b0487b98","event":{"kind":"output","task_id":"01a0d17a-a6dc-7090-8380-6563b0487b98","chunk":"{\n  \"chunk_id\": \"exec-23-1\",\n  \"command\": \"task-board handoff --help 2>&1 | head -40; echo ===; task-board worktree --help 2>&1 | head -30\",\n  \"description\": \"Inspect handoff and worktree commands\",\n  \"exit_code\": 0,\n  \"terminal_status\": \"completed\",\n  \"output\": \"Resolve the configured role end status, verify every checklist item and\\nat least one stored task-scoped outcome resource, and apply the ordinary\\ncascading status transition under one mutation lock.\\n\\nThe command fails closed with all missing evidence and does not change status.\\nAttach or update the outcome with the resource or mutation CLI before handoff.\\n\\nUsage:\\n  task-board handoff <ELEMENT-ID> [flags]\\n\\nFlags:\\n      --commit-ack string   Mover acknowledgement for an enforced done transition\\n      --format string       Output format: compact or json (default \\\"compact\\\")\\n  -h, --help                help for handoff\\n      --role string         Role whose configured end_status must be applied\\n\\nGlobal Flags:\\n      --board-dir string         Path to the board directory (overrides TASK_BOARD_DIR and config local.board_dir) (default \\\".task-board\\\")\\n      --context-profile string   Agent context profile override: full or lite\\n      --insecure                 Skip TLS certificate verification (for self-signed certs)\\n      --json                     Output in JSON format\\n      --no-update-check          Disable automatic update check\\n      --remote string            Remote board server URL (overrides TASK_BOARD_REMOTE)\\n      --remote-board string      Remote board ID (overrides TASK_BOARD_ID)\\n===\\nInspect and repair the Story-scoped Git workspaces that repository-mutating\\nspawns run in.\\n\\nEach Story gets one managed worktree under .temp/<STORY-ID>/worktree on a\\nshort-lived task-board/story/<STORY-ID> branch forked from trunk. Trunk is\\nspawn.worktree_isolation.integration_base_branch when configured, and otherwise\\nresolves from refs/remotes/origin/HEAD and then the current branch.\\n\\nThese commands require a local authoritative board. On a remote board they\\nrefuse with worktree_isolation_requires_local_board and do nothing else.\\n\\nUsage:\\n  task-board worktree [command]\\n\\nAvailable Commands:\\n  abort                 Stop using a Story workspace, preserving its work by default\\n  checkpoint            Commit an accepted leaf onto its Story branch while preserving integrating\\n  close-landed          Close an element whose accepted candidate is already on the protected trunk\\n  complete              Prove an accepted Story's code landed on its own repository, then record its board state in the board repository\\n  converge              Refresh a pinned Story workspace onto fresh trunk, carrying its uncommitted delta\\n  gc                    Release Story leases whose holding runs are provably terminal\\n  integrate             Land an accepted Story candidate on trunk and commit its board state\\n  integrating           Classify every element parked at integrating: awaiting a landing, board-only, already on trunk, or deferred\\n  invalidate-acceptance Release an invalidated or failed-revalidation acceptance back to rework\\n  obligations           List Change Request revisions that no live run owns\\n  prepare-landed-review Export a signed current-default tree for a new producer handoff and exact-tree review\\n  reconcile-trunk       Move the control root's trunk onto fresh protected authority when every local commit is already delivered there\\n  refresh-candidate     Refresh an initial or rework candidate base without losing uncommitted files\\n  repair                Re-materialize a recorded workspace whose worktree is missing\\n  start-landed-rework   Reprove a landed-review export and durably authorize normal producer rework\\n\",\n  \"original_output_bytes\": 3448,\n  \"original_output_tokens\": 862,\n  \"truncated\": false\n}","final_result":true}}}
